WEBVTT

00:04:28.806 --> 00:04:30.933
When people tell me
their stories about fun,

00:04:30.933 --> 00:04:33.936
it's really interesting,
because the details are all different,

00:04:33.978 --> 00:04:35.187
and often quite mundane,

00:04:35.187 --> 00:04:37.523
but the energy running
through them is the same.

00:04:37.565 --> 00:04:40.192
There were three factors
that are consistently present,

00:04:40.192 --> 00:04:43.112
to the point that I believe
they constitute a new definition,

00:04:43.154 --> 00:04:46.115
one that is a lot more accurate
than what's in the dictionary.

00:04:46.157 --> 00:04:49.744
And those three factors
are playfulness, connection and flow.

00:04:50.786 --> 00:04:51.912
So by playfulness,

00:04:51.954 --> 00:04:54.248
I do not mean you have to play games,

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:56.792
or, God forbid, make believe.

00:04:57.418 --> 00:04:59.962
I just mean having a lighthearted attitude